}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01EzKHNF5vSaJN45gyXATrYa","tool_input":{"command":"../../tools/flywheel/guard.sh finding lens=correctness+security file=tools/fleet/cost.go line=158 severity=medium claim=\"Per-line finite check does not stop the SUM overflowing to +Inf (two 1.7e308 lines) or the token sum wrapping negative; both lenses flagged it\" disposition=accepted","description":"Record finding: sum overflow"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01LUNAVigfC6dNcE2EBAaXQQ","tool_input":{"command":"../../tools/flywheel/guard.sh finding lens=simplicity file=tools/fleet/cost.go line=194 severity=medium claim=\"Two single-caller helpers replace what is a one-condition change at the call site; inlined\" disposition=accepted","description":"Record finding: helpers inlined"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_011BwEY3fUXFG2wCjSwZr3oA","tool_input":{"command":"../../tools/flywheel/guard.sh finding lens=simplicity file=tools/fleet/cost.go line=181 severity=low claim=\"Second comment paragraph restates the package header and Measured's field comment; dropped\" disposition=accepted","description":"Record finding: redundant comment"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01GmBQ4FSh2jdvRCAJ3sCJNK","tool_input":{"command":"../../tools/flywheel/guard.sh finding lens=correctness file=tools/fleet/cost_test.go line=153 severity=low claim=\"Refusal table omitted 1e309, +Inf and Infinity spellings; rows added\" disposition=accepted","description":"Record finding: missing table rows"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01YHMmcXeKYF8LkKGfCfSDAm","tool_input":{"command":"../../tools/flywheel/guard.sh finding lens=simplicity file=tools/fleet/cost_test.go line=185 severity=low claim=\"FleetWindowSpend check asserted only usd<0 and paid a second temp dir per row; now asserts exact usd on the same repo\" disposition=accepted","description":"Record finding: weak FleetWindowSpend assertion"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01WCKfRiLFHhE9qFU5u3PNcK","tool_input":{"command":"../../tools/flywheel/guard.sh finding lens=correctness file=tools/fleet/cost.go line=168 severity=low claim=\"A line with usd=NaN beside tokens=900 is Measured with dollars contributing 0; this is the pre-existing tokens-only shape the measured-in-tokens-only test already pins, not a regression\" disposition=rejected","description":"Record finding: mixed bad/good field (rejected)"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01Db1365qWTGgSAvXGdrjPcm","tool_input":{"command":"../../tools/flywheel/guard.sh finding lens=security file=tools/fleet/cost.go line=196 severity=low claim=\"usd=0 or a tiny positive still vouches a bead as measured so PerGreenPR can understate; pre-existing and out of fw-55c scope, worth its own bead\" disposition=ignored","description":"Record finding: zero-cost vouching (ignored)"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01NXJ6rACFNi7MK1VdsaBs7b","tool_input":{"command":"go build ./... && go test ./... 2>&1 | tail -5 && rm -f tools/fleet/fleet; git status --short","description":"Full build and test, then show status"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01VyjL5sT5EZSVsg6uG1BdfH","tool_input":{"command":"git config user.email","description":"Confirm commit identity is real (identity hook)"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":3,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":3,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":1,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":3,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{"general-purpose":3}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":75,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"Done. Ran solo (`run-context.json` `solo: true`), so no blackbird registration or reservation.\n\n## fw-55c — PR #75 open, bead left open\n\n**Bead:** `fw-55c` (w:1, bug) — a `NaN`/`Inf`/negative `usd=` in the audit ledger made `fleet cost -json` unrenderable and let `FleetWindowSpend` go negative with `ok=true`.\n\n**What I did:** Rejected at the reader, per the bead's design note. In `tools/fleet/cost.go:167-179`, a `usd`/`tokens` value that is NaN, infinite, negative, or **would overflow the running sum** now counts as unmeasured, not zero — two inline conditions at the existing parse site, stdlib only. Added `TestReadSpendRefusesNonFiniteAndNegativeCost` (12 table rows) which also asserts `json.Marshal` and `FleetWindowSpend` on every row.\n\n**Self-review (ADR 0013):** 7 findings recorded in `.flywheel/review.jsonl` (83 → 90). The important one: correctness *and* security lenses independently found that per-line checks don't stop two finite `1.7e308` lines summing to `+Inf` (or two `MaxInt64` token lines wrapping negative) — fixed in the same PR. Simplicity lens got my two helper functions inlined and the comment halved. One rejected (tokens-only lines being measured is existing behaviour), one ignored as out of scope: `usd=0` still vouches a bead as measured, so `PerGreenPR` can be understated — candidate for a new bead.\n\n**Gate:** pre-commit (gofmt, vet, vet-conformance, short tests, identity, beads) and pre-push guard all green; full `go test ./...` green.\n\n**PR:** https://github.com/jamesponwith/agentic-flywheel/pull/75 — two commits (fix + the `pr_opened` audit line riding along per the bookkeeping rule). Not merged; bead noted and left `in_progress` until it merges.\n\n**Loose ends:** `go build ./...` left an untracked `tools/fleet/fleet` binary in the worktree that the sandbox refused to let me `rm`; it is not committed and not gitignored — worth a `.gitignore` line or a `rm` on your side. I did not remove the worktree since the spawner owns it.","ttft_ms":2415,"type":"result","duration_ms":362649,"uuid":"6de0e6e1-cd13-4d3d-8dcb-98b715867156","ttft_stream_ms":1609,"time_to_request_ms":151,"queued_turn_count":0}
